(7541377, 1206590, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent. maybe just a hair more grainy than necessary, though. all the same, this should do well.</td>', 'excellent. maybe just a hair more grainy than necessary, though. all the same, this should do well.', '2017-10-29 11:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
