(7541380, 1206886, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent find, but i''m not a fan of the post-processing. and there may well have been some more compelling compositions with those subjects.<br/> <br/>these are by no means perfect, but take a look to get an idea as to what i''m talking about. <a href="//skippix.com/out-and-about/retired-monster/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">retired monster</a></td>', 'excellent find, but i''m not a fan of the post-processing. and there may well have been some more compelling compositions with those subjects. these are by no means perfect, but take a look to get an idea as to what i''m talking about. retired monster', '2017-10-29 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541381, 1207039, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome find! i probably would have brought out just a bit more detail in the shadows, but that''s just me. hope it''s not too subtle for the voters (it took me more than a moment to grasp what i was seeing).</td>', 'awesome find! i probably would have brought out just a bit more detail in the shadows, but that''s just me. hope it''s not too subtle for the voters (it took me more than a moment to grasp what i was seeing).', '2017-10-29 12:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541382, 1207001, 23394, '<td valign="top">bam! nailed it!<br/> <br/>if i could suggest anything, it would to have been to try a slightly elevated perspective to pick up more water and less sky (because those clouds come through in the reflection). you would also get more of a sense of the distant horizon, thus furthering the narrative of being lost in the middle of nowhere.<br/> <br/>all the same, i''ll be shocked if this doesn''t wind up near the top.</td>', 'bam! nailed it! if i could suggest anything, it would to have been to try a slightly elevated perspective to pick up more water and less sky (because those clouds come through in the reflection). you would also get more of a sense of the distant horizon, thus furthering the narrative of being lost in the middle of nowhere. all the same, i''ll be shocked if this doesn''t wind up near the top.', '2017-10-29 12:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541383, 1206932, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but the worn stone is not enough for me to feel abandoned. this is more like "placed". maybe if teddy was dirty and torn, tipped over or face down. as is, teddy looks simply out of place.</td>', 'sorry, but the worn stone is not enough for me to feel abandoned. this is more like "placed". maybe if teddy was dirty and torn, tipped over or face down. as is, teddy looks simply out of place.', '2017-10-29 12:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541384, 1207055, 23394, '<td valign="top">so much potential here, but the image quality is killing it for me. can''t tell if it''s on purpose, or just the result of too much cropping. not a fan of the composition or perspective: not sure what you really want me to look at or to see. i mean, yes, it''s an abandoned building, but so what?</td>', 'so much potential here, but the image quality is killing it for me. can''t tell if it''s on purpose, or just the result of too much cropping. not a fan of the composition or perspective: not sure what you really want me to look at or to see. i mean, yes, it''s an abandoned building, but so what?', '2017-10-29 12:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541385, 1207003, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice find, but i''m not a fan of the post-processing. seems to be a bit over-done when the subject didn''t really require it.<br/> <br/>one other thing to consider for things like this is to shoot from a higher perspective, even if it means carrying a ladder (or step-ladder). as is, this is an on-the-street, eye-level view. imagine if you had been high enough to have been eye-level at a point between the tops of the doors and the 2nd floor windows.</td>', 'nice find, but i''m not a fan of the post-processing. seems to be a bit over-done when the subject didn''t really require it. one other thing to consider for things like this is to shoot from a higher perspective, even if it means carrying a ladder (or step-ladder). as is, this is an on-the-street, eye-level view. imagine if you had been high enough to have been eye-level at a point between the tops of the doors and the 2nd floor windows.', '2017-10-29 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541386, 1207058, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think your composition is off. when i see the image, i''m not sure what the subject is. then i see the ladder, almost as if it''s an afterthought - but your title would suggest it''s the subject. the high contrast is a bit off-putting - too bright in the sun, too dark in the shadows.</td>', 'i think your composition is off. when i see the image, i''m not sure what the subject is. then i see the ladder, almost as if it''s an afterthought - but your title would suggest it''s the subject. the high contrast is a bit off-putting - too bright in the sun, too dark in the shadows.', '2017-10-29 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541387, 1207020, 23394, '<td valign="top">lots of opportunity here, but i''m not a fan of the processing or the blown sky. maybe a different perspective would have yielded a more dynamic image?</td>', 'lots of opportunity here, but i''m not a fan of the processing or the blown sky. maybe a different perspective would have yielded a more dynamic image?', '2017-10-29 12:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
