(7541412, 1207044, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes it''s abandoned, but this rail car appears kind of sprightly.  As a matter of fact, since it''s emerging from the outright oblivion of the upper left corner, there''s almost a sense of resurrection here.  The colors are rich, and the semi-circle of green further enlivens.  The composition is well-balanced.  <br/>At first I saw the chock in front of the left wheel -  from our perspective  - as a human hand.  Happy Halloween.<br/>Excellent image.</td>', 'Yes it''s abandoned, but this rail car appears kind of sprightly.  As a matter of fact, since it''s emerging from the outright oblivion of the upper left corner, there''s almost a sense of resurrection here.  The colors are rich, and the semi-circle of green further enlivens.  The composition is well-balanced.  At first I saw the chock in front of the left wheel -  from our perspective  - as a human hand.  Happy Halloween.Excellent image.', '2017-10-29 14:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541413, 1207056, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I like the background buildings and the splash of red.  The  bright center feels a bit overwhelming.  Maybe it''s a shaft of light to transport the bike to bike heaven.  A good photograph.</td>', 'Interesting image.  I like the background buildings and the splash of red.  The  bright center feels a bit overwhelming.  Maybe it''s a shaft of light to transport the bike to bike heaven.  A good photograph.', '2017-10-29 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541414, 1207035, 173844, '<td valign="top">Crisp example of deterioration.  You can see the paint or plastic delaminating over time and weather.  But the colors are still cheerful.  Reminds me of fish evolving into land creatures, those first tentative steps -  or revolutions in this instance.  Nice image.</td>', 'Crisp example of deterioration.  You can see the paint or plastic delaminating over time and weather.  But the colors are still cheerful.  Reminds me of fish evolving into land creatures, those first tentative steps -  or revolutions in this instance.  Nice image.', '2017-10-29 14:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541415, 1207001, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''ve often wondered how vehicles so often wind up on their backs.  Still have no idea.  Maybe to establish abandonment, don''t even think of mounting a rescue.  This is a great example of that ilk.  The crisp black and white treatment, the lowering sky and the expansive landscape all combine to give this image power and finality.  The foreground grasses establish necessary depth.  Strong mood.  Strong photograph.</td>', 'I''ve often wondered how vehicles so often wind up on their backs.  Still have no idea.  Maybe to establish abandonment, don''t even think of mounting a rescue.  This is a great example of that ilk.  The crisp black and white treatment, the lowering sky and the expansive landscape all combine to give this image power and finality.  The foreground grasses establish necessary depth.  Strong mood.  Strong photograph.', '2017-10-29 14:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541419, 1207019, 173844, '<td valign="top">Without the boat''s name this would still be an admirable image, but what charm it adds.  There''s something stoically noble about this attenuated craft.  The spindly angled supports are echoed by the pilings, if that''s what they are, by the shore and the barely visible line of telephone or electric poles on the flat, slender horizon.  Overcast and still.</td>', 'Without the boat''s name this would still be an admirable image, but what charm it adds.  There''s something stoically noble about this attenuated craft.  The spindly angled supports are echoed by the pilings, if that''s what they are, by the shore and the barely visible line of telephone or electric poles on the flat, slender horizon.  Overcast and still.', '2017-10-29 15:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541426, 1207024, 173844, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old postcard with its faded coloration and its centered, declarative composition.  I like how the generous foreground is taken up by the field gone wild, establishing the extent of abandonment.  The sky is cunningly festooned with dark clouds in the gray background, as if the smokestack has mysteriously returned to life.  I very much like the overall feel.</td>', 'Looks like an old postcard with its faded coloration and its centered, declarative composition.  I like how the generous foreground is taken up by the field gone wild, establishing the extent of abandonment.  The sky is cunningly festooned with dark clouds in the gray background, as if the smokestack has mysteriously returned to life.  I very much like the overall feel.', '2017-10-29 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541429, 1206886, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic cars and trucks never die, they simply rust away.  These look handsome and proud, poised to hit the road.  The edenic setting is likewise lush and and promising, cows and all.  A latter day John Constable painting.  Fine, fun image.</td>', 'Classic cars and trucks never die, they simply rust away.  These look handsome and proud, poised to hit the road.  The edenic setting is likewise lush and and promising, cows and all.  A latter day John Constable painting.  Fine, fun image.', '2017-10-29 17:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541438, 1207062, 173844, '<td valign="top">A wide angle lens is used to great effect here, exaggerating the perspective and establishing the inside/outside feeling, even though it''s all outside.  There''s a mood of quiet and magic.  The composition is complex and satisfying.  The sky is pretty.  Enchanting.</td>', 'A wide angle lens is used to great effect here, exaggerating the perspective and establishing the inside/outside feeling, even though it''s all outside.  There''s a mood of quiet and magic.  The composition is complex and satisfying.  The sky is pretty.  Enchanting.', '2017-10-29 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541456, 1207039, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific, intimate study of this very old car -  look at the headlamp  - lost, sort of, in the depths of a thick forest.  Or at least it feels like a deep, thick forest.  Raiders of the Lost Ark-ish.  Swaddled in time.  I love how the spreading rays of sunlight seem like a spiderweb. I don''t know if this is real or obtained through processing -  just curious.  First prize for the most abandoned looking object in the challenge.  Really fine image.</td>', 'Terrific, intimate study of this very old car -  look at the headlamp  - lost, sort of, in the depths of a thick forest.  Or at least it feels like a deep, thick forest.  Raiders of the Lost Ark-ish.  Swaddled in time.  I love how the spreading rays of sunlight seem like a spiderweb. I don''t know if this is real or obtained through processing -  just curious.  First prize for the most abandoned looking object in the challenge.  Really fine image.', '2017-10-29 17:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541457, 1207003, 173844, '<td valign="top">This building looks like it was abandoned during wartime.  The denuded canopy is being turned into an arbor.  Black and white suitably fits the plaintive atmosphere.  The only distractions, to my eyes at least, are the newly cut, or amputated, limbs of the tree.  Aside from that I like the image.</td>', 'This building looks like it was abandoned during wartime.  The denuded canopy is being turned into an arbor.  Black and white suitably fits the plaintive atmosphere.  The only distractions, to my eyes at least, are the newly cut, or amputated, limbs of the tree.  Aside from that I like the image.', '2017-10-29 18:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541465, 1207039, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fascinating! Makes me wonder what its story is. By the looks of it, another season or two and nobody will know it''s there.</td>', 'Fascinating! Makes me wonder what its story is. By the looks of it, another season or two and nobody will know it''s there.', '2017-10-29 20:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541466, 1206886, 97225, '<td valign="top">They all look like they are ripe for restoration and would be worthwhile projects. I love the rich rustiness amidst the green.</td>', 'They all look like they are ripe for restoration and would be worthwhile projects. I love the rich rustiness amidst the green.', '2017-10-29 20:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541467, 1207001, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great find, great photo. My favourite in this challenge.</td>', 'Great find, great photo. My favourite in this challenge.', '2017-10-29 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541472, 1206652, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic image.</td>', 'Great dramatic image.', '2017-10-29 20:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541473, 1207001, 114285, '<td valign="top">Got to be a winner, great find. Excellent processing too.</td>', 'Got to be a winner, great find. Excellent processing too.', '2017-10-29 20:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541478, 1207007, 173844, '<td valign="top">After looking at this a bit I felt some dissonance lurking  --   namely, it looks like an old photograph of an old plane, but that plane would have been new-ish, probably, when the shot was taken, in order for it to look old now.  Or maybe my logic is faulty, so then please disregard and accept my apologies.<br/>In any case, I like the directness and the processing.  And I can also enjoy that sense of dislocation.  If it''s really there.</td>', 'After looking at this a bit I felt some dissonance lurking  --   namely, it looks like an old photograph of an old plane, but that plane would have been new-ish, probably, when the shot was taken, in order for it to look old now.  Or maybe my logic is faulty, so then please disregard and accept my apologies.In any case, I like the directness and the processing.  And I can also enjoy that sense of dislocation.  If it''s really there.', '2017-10-29 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541480, 1206652, 173844, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Dorothy''s house in Kansas.  That the grounds about it are tended indicates a human presence somewhere.  I like the many shades of gray in the roof and outer sheathing.  The roiling sky is nicely ominous.  It''s very sharpened. The sofa is welcoming.  The antenna was probably put up at a later point in time to keep in touch with Oz.</td>', 'This reminds me of Dorothy''s house in Kansas.  That the grounds about it are tended indicates a human presence somewhere.  I like the many shades of gray in the roof and outer sheathing.  The roiling sky is nicely ominous.  It''s very sharpened. The sofa is welcoming.  The antenna was probably put up at a later point in time to keep in touch with Oz.', '2017-10-29 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541485, 1207037, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here''s a ghostly presence of tilted planes and jumbled angles under the onslaught of eager vegetation.  It''s so overgrown that the building itself is as much inference as actuality.  I very much like this curious hybrid under a busy sky, filling the frame and enjoyable.</td>', 'Here''s a ghostly presence of tilted planes and jumbled angles under the onslaught of eager vegetation.  It''s so overgrown that the building itself is as much inference as actuality.  I very much like this curious hybrid under a busy sky, filling the frame and enjoyable.', '2017-10-29 21:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
