(7541523, 1206886, 68504, '<td valign="top">kind of thing that could be overdone and or cliche. but here the light and colours make a real composition.</td>', 'kind of thing that could be overdone and or cliche. but here the light and colours make a real composition.', '2017-10-29 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
