(7541664, 1207045, 16148, '<td valign="top">Two elements, well maybe three elements, of this photograph really work well IMO.<br/> <br/>1. the perspective of the wall continues in its own shadow.<br/>2. as others have mentioned, the detail in the beach tree leaves lower right.  A nice place for the viewers eye to settle.<br/>3. the burst of life and light coming through the impenetrable wall''s doorway.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-10-31 00:19:20.</i></td>', 'Two elements, well maybe three elements, of this photograph really work well IMO. 1. the perspective of the wall continues in its own shadow.2. as others have mentioned, the detail in the beach tree leaves lower right.  A nice place for the viewers eye to settle.3. the burst of life and light coming through the impenetrable wall''s doorway.', '2017-10-30 17:31:50.000000', '2017-10-31 00:19:20.000000', 0);
